# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production mode). The packaged app has no
# same-origin server for a relative /api path to resolve against, unlike the web
# client — see client/src/utils/api.js.
#
# NOTE: confirm this is the live production domain before shipping — DEPLOY.md has
# it in two places with a www/non-www mismatch (root pokerisrael.org 301-redirects
# to www.pokerisrael.org per its DNS setup section, so www is almost certainly the
# real one, but it's a one-line fix here if not).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://www.pokerisrael.org/api
